# X-band Chivo plots (server-side only; used by /api/xbandRadarImages and /api/imageData)
#
# Option A — Docker: mount host web-files to /XBand and set:
#   X_BAND_PATH=/XBand
# Resolves to /XBand/PRODUCTS/Chivo/plots
#
# Option B — Set the plots directory explicitly (overrides X_BAND_PATH):
#   XBAND_CHIVO_PLOTS_ROOT=/XBand/PRODUCTS/Chivo/plots
#
# Option C — Omit both; fallback is the legacy /net/k2/storage/... path (bare-metal).
#
# Production: nginx should proxy /api/imageData to Django (same as /api/xbandRadarImages) so PNGs
# use the server container’s X_BAND_PATH. The Django server must mount web-files and set
# X_BAND_PATH (or XBAND_CHIVO_PLOTS_ROOT). Without that, listings or images can 404.
#
# Local / dev-only: Next route can proxy to Django via INTERNAL_API_URL or (in production) default
# http://server:8000; see app/api/imageData/route.ts.

# X_BAND_PATH=/XBand
# XBAND_CHIVO_PLOTS_ROOT=
# INTERNAL_API_URL=http://server:8000
